# Two projects named Ideas are told apart by their paths in the picker; the one chosen is the one added to.
file <<END
Work:
	Ideas:
		- w
Home:
	Ideas:
		- h
END
keys qq
type Paint fence
keys <Space> /
see Ideas  Work
see Ideas  Home
type ideas
keys <Down> <Enter>
see Quick Add → Home › Ideas
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	Ideas:
		- w
Home:
	Ideas:
		- h
		- Paint fence
END
